r package damage were observed.","evidence_ids":["cmd-f29f2b2ff1ce4c1a","global:after_executor:node1:temporary-files","global:after_executor:node1:failed-services","global:after_executor:node1:package-health"]},"overall_summary":"All material task outcomes are satisfied. HTTPS works on port 8443, renewal-window behavior and hourly automation are configured and exercised, and certificate changes occur without request interruption. The provider-wide restart protocol is complete: healthy pre-restart state, acknowledged reboot, changed boot identity, and recovered HTTPS, certificate, timer, firewall, and listener state are directly shown and corroborated by lifecycle snapshots.","limitations":["The expiring-certificate renewal was triggered by manually starting the same service used by the timer; evidence does not capture an hourly timer firing while an expiring certificate was installed. Timer activation, scheduling, persistence, and the complete renewal path are nevertheless directly demonstrated."]}
